# Targets are chosen before costs are paid (CR 601.2c, 601.2h), so Bone Splinters may target the very creature its additional
# cost then sacrifices. Bot1's only creature is Ornithopter and Bot2 has none: Bot1 can still cast Bone Splinters, targeting
# Ornithopter and sacrificing it; on resolution its only target is gone (CR 400.7, 608.2b) and it does nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Ornithopter
Bone Splinters
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Bone Splinters.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Bone Splinters; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp
LeftBattlefield = Ornithopter
